This repository contains an experimental i64-scale LIN clone of Aave V3
percentMul / wadDiv / health factor and an original C11 oracle.

Upstream aave-v3-core (aave/aave-v3-core v1.19.4) was licensed BUSL-1.1 with
Change Date 27 January 2023; the Change License is MIT.
See https://github.com/aave/aave-v3-core and
https://opensource.org/licenses/MIT

Proofs live in https://github.com/kbelludoo/lin-open
